<title>USA: TABLE- Zapata Q3 June 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Zapata Q3 June 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   0.18		    $0.04</p>
<p> Shr cont oper	     0.11		     0.03</p>
<p> Net			    4.8			1.2</p>
<p> Revs			  31.0		     20.9</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    27.2		     29.6</p>
<p>Nine months</p>
<p> Shr			   0.33		     0.39</p>
<p> Shr cont oper	     0.25		     0.05</p>
<p> Net			    9.5		     11.5</p>
<p> Revs			  79.6		     58.8</p>
<p> Avg			   28.8		     29.6</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Zapata Corp's 1997 third-quarter net earnings include after-tax income of $1.9 million, or 0.07 share, from discontinued operations. The 1996 third quarter earnings include $200,000 gain from discontinued operations, or $0.01 a share.</p>
<p>The 1997 net earnings include an after-tax gain of $2.3 million, or $0.08 a share, from discontinued operations and the 1996 earnings an after-tax gain of $9.3 milion, or $0.32 a share from discontinued operations.</p>
